== Overview ==
The '''Mutant Toilet''' is an [[Enemies|enemy]] added in the [[Episode 62 Update]]. It walks like all other mutant enemies, but it does not stun [[units]]. It has lower HP than [[Boss Toilet|Boss Toilets]], but moves faster. He Appears In Wave 21 of Medium Mode, Wave 12 of Hard Mode and Wave 6 Of Nightmare Mode

